    "description": "You are purchasing a \"Grandmas MCM Lot Gold/Brown Seth Thomas Clock Avon Pens Owl Chockin 24k +++\" in \"Used\" condition.\nEclectic vintage lot perfect for collectors, decorators, or resellers who love unique, nostalgic pieces. This mixed group includes books, yearbooks, vinyl record albums, a small ceramic creamer, decorative glass and ceramic dishes, boxed stationery or note cards, and other small vintage curios. You’ll find charming artwork on the record sleeves, classic hardback books with character, and small tabletop or display pieces that add instant old-world charm to any room. The variety makes this lot ideal for crafting vignettes, photo props, or starting a vintage collection without hunting for each piece individually. Items show normal wear from age, giving them that authentic vintage look many people love. A great bundle if you enjoy the warmth and personality of older items. Keywords: vintage mixed lot, vintage home decor, vintage books, vintage records, ceramic creamer, decorative glass dish, collectible ephemera, nostalgia decor, photo prop lot\nAll items show general wear consistent with age and use. The books and yearbooks have edge and corner wear and some discoloration to covers and spines. The record covers show rubbing and corner wear. The small ceramic creamer and decorative dishes have some surface wear but no obvious chips or cracks visible. Metal and glass pieces show minor scuffs and light tarnish. Boxes show light staining, edge wear, and some discoloration on lids and corners. Sold as is.\nCondition Notes:\nAll items show general wear consistent with age and use. The books and yearbooks have edge and corner wear and some discoloration to covers and spines. The record covers show rubbing and corner wear. The small ceramic creamer and decorative dishes have some surface wear but no obvious chips or cracks visible. Metal and glass pieces show minor scuffs and light tarnish. Boxes show light staining, edge wear, and so